{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50091","headline":"曲石凫 · 无名氏","name":"曲石凫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲爱水石奇，不厌湖畔行。\n每登曲石凫，则有远兴生。\n𢼨差半湖□，宛若龙象形\n又如琅琊台，□盘枕沧溟。\n醉人入岛来，将醉强爲醒。\n扣船复摇棹，学歌渔父声。\n呼我上酒船，更深江海情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}